 buffer (1a),\nthe spring (1b), the boot (1c), the lower shim (1d) and the shock\nabsorber (1e).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018251.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Assemble the shock absorber-spring assembly components and fit\nit on the compression tool.</p><p>2. Tighten the nut (2a) for the upper shock absorber buffer to torque\nusing the tool (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>UPPER REAR DAMPER ATTACHMENT 9S.M.)</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>8.6 - 9.4</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.138.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018252.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Loosen the support tool and\nremove the rear shock absorber-spring assembly.</p><p>Reposition the tool used for dismantling-reassembling the\nshock absorber-spring assembly.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238225\">4450B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238195\">4420A10</a></p><p>Check and, if necessary, adjust the wheel\ngeometry \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238218\">4450A40</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238813\">7040B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238809\">7040B15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238928\">7050A47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238807\">7040B06</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238225\">4450B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238195\">4420A10</a></p><p>1. Fit the flanges (1a, 1b) on the tool (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Flanges</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.238.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Flange</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.787.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.089.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018253.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p>1. Fit the shock absorber-spring assembly on the support tool (1a)\nand compress it.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jp